{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 TT-LuckyMidiChance\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 MIDI-only probability and generative processor for REAPER. CHANCE drops or passes notes by probability; COND gates them on bar position; STRUM, RATCHET and DEVIATE reshape timing and velocity; EUCLID gates notes onto a Euclidean step pattern; MUTATE perturbs streams deterministically from a seed. With a locked SEED the randomness is reproducible. Operated entirely from the drawn front panel \u8212- parameters stay automatable.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
