{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Clean & Flat Acid\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A REAPER theme: dark graphite panels, one acid-green accent, flat square buttons. The theme runs on its own. The adjuster window needs ReaImGui 0.10+. Baking fonts, the selection frame and the logo watermark need js_ReaScriptAPI. The UI-scale buttons and the silent startup action need the SWS extension. All three are in the ReaTeam Extensions repository. ReaPack installs the scripts next to each other under Scripts/TimTechlor ReaScripts/Themes/. Load "Tim Techlor Theme Adjuster" once. After that, Options > Themes > Theme Adjuster opens it while this theme is selected.\par}
}
